    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young Plant Spirit who is trying to save his ancestral Valley. It is dying from an unknown source of infection, with bugs becoming more dangerous and plants no longer growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened and who will help you fight back? Start the adventure and find out the answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/b26220144ddf3c206fd675cc3b770293.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/cd695c9285e2b94881f583b5de3e5908.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path lays from the safe and familiar garden to the farthest corner of the Valley, where the source of the poison is hiding. Our hero will travel through the forest and mountains. And in the caves Spirit will have to face another danger - pitch black darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/b9e90199574627fde1d8d10c5285ba2a.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/7563888eb8af18f6c7927f8df8ba9e74.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits don\u2019t have bodies, so they are unable to affect the world around them. The only things they can do are moving and observing. But after long years of living in the Valley spirits learned another trick - possessing plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/fbdda569b131acc1158692810e988b56.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/2aa51bd7d664e609248fb77b4cbe6ef3.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While hiding inside a plant Spirit can shoot seeds to plant new plants or to protect himself from hungry bugs. Each plant shoots differently, for example, ficus shoots poisonous juice and chestnut throws a heavy seed that strikes down anything in it\u2019s way. Each plant can be useful in a different situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/4a9ca33904db113a75ac024b57d7f05a.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/63f9142566d34de17ca0925b0dfe1f4f.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry bugs and exploding batteries - those are the enemies that Spirit will have to face on his way. Each of them has a weakness against a certain type of plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/a1f391f8748e4a40eaac3a0bfff5d661.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/93f40126ab25fadd67a356d0f03925be.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our hero is going on a dangerous journey but he won\u2019t have to be on his own, Old Spirit, his teacher, will help and support him the entire time. From the safety of the garden, of course. Also during his adventure Spirit will meet new unexpected friends, some of which will join and travel with him. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/18817cc420bd289426f7840641b70b6b.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/6e8872fb34286c3498ad437b5ce1bf96.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save endangered plants Spirit will have to collect new seeds while travelling. And, of course, learn how to use the new plants. Old Spirit gathered all the information about Valley\u2019s plant life in a handbook which Spirit will be able to read at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/4a2336ee972132ed31107af7442e98c3.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/4071e0fb3902822bf6f2de517f00c07f.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The source of the poison, giant battery monster, won\u2019t be an easy target. To save the Valley Spirit will have to figure out a strategy and use the most effective plants. And his friends will help him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/6563b27697773ac5062ad44bb614c6c3.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young Plant Spirit who is trying to save his ancestral Valley. It is dying from an unknown source of infection, with bugs becoming more dangerous and plants no longer growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened and who will help you fight back? Start the adventure and find out the answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/b26220144ddf3c206fd675cc3b770293.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/cd695c9285e2b94881f583b5de3e5908.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path lays from the safe and familiar garden to the farthest corner of the Valley, where the source of the poison is hiding. Our hero will travel through the forest and mountains. And in the caves Spirit will have to face another danger - pitch black darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/b9e90199574627fde1d8d10c5285ba2a.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/7563888eb8af18f6c7927f8df8ba9e74.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits don\u2019t have bodies, so they are unable to affect the world around them. The only things they can do are moving and observing. But after long years of living in the Valley spirits learned another trick - possessing plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/fbdda569b131acc1158692810e988b56.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/2aa51bd7d664e609248fb77b4cbe6ef3.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While hiding inside a plant Spirit can shoot seeds to plant new plants or to protect himself from hungry bugs. Each plant shoots differently, for example, ficus shoots poisonous juice and chestnut throws a heavy seed that strikes down anything in it\u2019s way. Each plant can be useful in a different situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/4a9ca33904db113a75ac024b57d7f05a.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/63f9142566d34de17ca0925b0dfe1f4f.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry bugs and exploding batteries - those are the enemies that Spirit will have to face on his way. Each of them has a weakness against a certain type of plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/a1f391f8748e4a40eaac3a0bfff5d661.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/93f40126ab25fadd67a356d0f03925be.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our hero is going on a dangerous journey but he won\u2019t have to be on his own, Old Spirit, his teacher, will help and support him the entire time. From the safety of the garden, of course. Also during his adventure Spirit will meet new unexpected friends, some of which will join and travel with him. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/18817cc420bd289426f7840641b70b6b.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/6e8872fb34286c3498ad437b5ce1bf96.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save endangered plants Spirit will have to collect new seeds while travelling. And, of course, learn how to use the new plants. Old Spirit gathered all the information about Valley\u2019s plant life in a handbook which Spirit will be able to read at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/4a2336ee972132ed31107af7442e98c3.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/4071e0fb3902822bf6f2de517f00c07f.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The source of the poison, giant battery monster, won\u2019t be an easy target. To save the Valley Spirit will have to figure out a strategy and use the most effective plants. And his friends will help him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528640/extras/6563b27697773ac5062ad44bb614c6c3.avif?t=1741682492\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Valley is in trouble! It's infected by thrown out batteries. Plants are endangered by poisoned soil and hungry bugs munching on every leaf or branch they can find. Only young Plant Spirit can find the source of the harm. Fight bugs, collect and plant new seeds and seek allies to save the Valley!",
